th’s attention."}]]}]]}]}]]]}]
14:["$","section",null,{"className":"case-section","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Decisions"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"What was chosen, and what it cost"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"case-decisions","children":[["$","article","Reviewing the live product",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Reviewing the live product"}],["$","dl",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Over"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Reviewing a staging environment"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Because"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"The gap between the two is exactly the set of problems nobody has recorded."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"It cost"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Real journeys and real data, so the review has to be designed carefully rather than pointed and fired."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","article","Judging against named principles",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Judging against named principles"}],["$","dl",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Over"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Asking a model what it thinks of the experience"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Because"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"A finding has to be arguable, with reasoning anyone in the room can check or challenge."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"It cost"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Principles miss what they were never written for, so this sets a floor on quality rather than a ceiling."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","article","Ending in a ranked list",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Ending in a ranked list"}],["$","dl",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Over"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Handing the findings over and letting teams triage"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Because"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"A list of problems is work for whoever receives it. A ranked roadmap is a decision already made."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"It cost"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Ranking is a judgement call, and you own the argument when a team disagrees with where their issue landed."}]]}]]}]]}]]}]]}]
15:["$","div",null,{"className":"case-close","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"case-section","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Outcome"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"What came of it"}],[["$","p","The whole product gets covered against a",{"className":"case-copy","children":"The whole product gets covered against a known standard in days, so the problems are on the table while there is still time to act on them."}],["$","p","The output is a roadmap: every finding r",{"className":"case-copy","children":"The output is a roadmap: every finding ranked and explained, worked through by design, product and tech together."}],["$","p","It sets a floor rather than a ceiling — ",{"className":"case-copy","children":"It sets a floor rather than a ceiling — it catches what should never have shipped, which frees research and design for the questions a principle cannot answer."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"case-section","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Lesson"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"What it cost me to learn"}],[["$","p","A review that only lists faults reads as",{"className":"case-copy","children":"A review that only lists faults reads as an attack on the people who built the thing. Recording what works alongside what does not, and ending in a ranked plan, is what made teams ask for the next one."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
